blocks.en:
The prompt includes specialist identifiers with mechanisms truncated to
130 characters, and task identifiers, domains, and user triggers (up to
300 characters each), in batches of 25 tasks: ⬇ Route each task to ONE specialist ( or base ) using ONLY the task description / trigger . You have no execution trace , tool output , or score . Each specialist fixes a specific failure mode of the base agent . SPECIALISTS ( id | mechanism ): < catalogue > TASKS ( id | domain | trigger ): < task batch > Pick a specialist only when the description clearly fits it ; otherwise choose base . Return a confidence in [0,1]. Output only JSON : {"< task - id >": {" cluster ": "< id - or - base >", " confidence ": <0..1>}, ...}

blocks.zh:
